{"screen_name": "IcelandCrow", "file": "IcelandCrow", "name": "游冰婪", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1986446914418843648/h3I9L0Vt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1009024795684438016/1739249508/1500x500", "description": "20↑ 日本語/中文 低浮上 STS/ベルユミ/モスエク/くいな 雑", "total_works": 5, "scraped_works": 5, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 3500, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00"}], "video": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T09:03:02.973236+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 3500, "video": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 3500, "max": 3500}, "video": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/IcelandCrow", "name": "IcelandCrow"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@IcelandCrow/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/943deebf/uploads/origins/7c81531f-676e-4d03-8dfe-76db998ceda1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f47dbfed8ef1b95d5e96dc1b67d53ad6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/943deebf/uploads/origins/7c81531f-676e-4d03-8dfe-76db998ceda1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f47dbfed8ef1b95d5e96dc1b67d53ad6, https://si.imgix.net/943deebf/uploads/origins/7c81531f-676e-4d03-8dfe-76db998ceda1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2c4d7255cb4ab7e2be6d59ac235ee9c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/943deebf/uploads/origins/7c81531f-676e-4d03-8dfe-76db998ceda1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f18f5d86c9b1a4391a86897714faed1a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "老师好！！在这里刷到了您的摸鱼页很喜欢风格，如果可以的话想约一下双人互动页！如果价格不合适也可以调整！\n是两个角色的向导哨兵au，一位叫林晓，一位叫吴令枫，详细设定都在链接里，尤其是那张名称叫问卷的图对角色概括写的比较简单易懂，可以参考看看！\n想看的互动有掐脖子（吴掐林，林在很嚣张不屑的笑着）、林玩吴头发、咬吴的手指、类似的…您也可以根据资料随意发挥！感觉部分氛围会偏黑暗压抑点？不过主要看您的感想和发挥！！\n如果愿意考虑一下就太好了！！感谢！\n参考链接：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-1J80GxTZWqev_qTOMCTWVoNLukmqA-S", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IcelandCrow/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/73afa3d7/uploads/origins/7ffb017e-3e1d-4db4-aad5-efd609b41707?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=734fc00d8c64be88c90ef9d607cca9da", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/73afa3d7/uploads/origins/7ffb017e-3e1d-4db4-aad5-efd609b41707?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=734fc00d8c64be88c90ef9d607cca9da, https://si.imgix.net/73afa3d7/uploads/origins/7ffb017e-3e1d-4db4-aad5-efd609b41707?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54be642f84d57441301016b938fa9ae4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/73afa3d7/uploads/origins/7ffb017e-3e1d-4db4-aad5-efd609b41707?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2d52b380b453ad852e2a81dffa19114 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，我非常喜欢你的多互动插画，比如 https://skeb.jp/@IcelandCrow/works/3 ！我想让我的朋友和我的原创角色在一起。他们在霍格沃茨魔法学院上学。\n\n他们是远亲表兄弟。没有人知道他们之间真正的血缘关系，因为他们每次都会改变答案，但他们仍然把对方当作家人。\n\n罗塞塔（女）（170 厘米）：\n她是一个半吸血鬼，幻想着与其他人之间的浪漫。怪人。\nhttps://sta.sh/27d8zuuvyxn?edit=1\n\n克罗诺斯（男）（168 厘米）：\n他是一个无忧无虑的家伙，总是面带微笑，随波逐流。\nhttps://sta.sh/0uk79g3f5c5\n\n关系：\n-罗塞塔很有钱，会给克罗诺斯花钱，给他买零食和玩具。\n-他们通常不怀好意，一起搞恶作剧\n-他们很亲热，并倾向于以家庭的方式表现出来（例如，拥抱、搂抱等）\n-他们喜欢看 Shoujo 漫画，因为这是 Rosetta 的爱好\n-傻傻的、健康的（柏拉图式的）\n谢谢", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IcelandCrow/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d49b338/uploads/origins/3550f543-f647-47d5-94b4-4764b0c50c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5df58efb91edea47fcbd5d257f50f779", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2d49b338/uploads/origins/3550f543-f647-47d5-94b4-4764b0c50c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5df58efb91edea47fcbd5d257f50f779, https://si.imgix.net/2d49b338/uploads/origins/3550f543-f647-47d5-94b4-4764b0c50c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19d1bc0c290d1bef4fe8c7aad82f2adc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2d49b338/uploads/origins/3550f543-f647-47d5-94b4-4764b0c50c7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59e86558e71c4fe973498d220292f2e6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "早上好！很喜欢老师的画风，想向您投递一份单人摸鱼页的委托，如果觉得我投的价格不合适的话，也可以改价格。\n\n奥托是一名出色的法师，在历史悠久的学府就读。他能力很强，性格孤傲，因为长着一对奇异的旋角，一直被别人敬而远之，也常被别人议论。但其实即使存在一些表面上的尊重和礼仪，他也并没有真正地看得起大多数周围的人。和他天才一般的音律、法术天赋一样广为人所知的是他傲慢的性格。\n\n角色相关信息我放在链接里了。我希望能出现火焰和音符的元素。如果您能接受这份委托，我会感激不尽！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5X7ENRnsriOEzhRaJppCfAtjBP9n0f9\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-5X7ENRnsriOEzhRaJppCfAtjBP9n0f9", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IcelandCrow/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/77781895/uploads/origins/5303eae2-7db9-4def-aa2b-bd29d074ed1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45521ea9bbf69aa94df0c152d9b84670", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/77781895/uploads/origins/5303eae2-7db9-4def-aa2b-bd29d074ed1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=45521ea9bbf69aa94df0c152d9b84670, https://si.imgix.net/77781895/uploads/origins/5303eae2-7db9-4def-aa2b-bd29d074ed1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39db19696101b6927914f8af83432b6c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/77781895/uploads/origins/5303eae2-7db9-4def-aa2b-bd29d074ed1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4c9778132af912bead241c1432aeb2be 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。アピール有難うございます。\n\n私の2人のOCのアートをお願いしたいのですが。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1o5wVZm2_d96skaWohudJzxVatK2kXtGI\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LUJ26pW96iTvWvY3kWxSPn5rqCq_vNWi\n\nDIAはメロディーより少し背が高く。DIAはクールなお姉さんという雰囲気で、メロディーはちょっとおてんば娘という感じです。\n\nご自由に描いてください。先生にとってかっこいいシーンであればうれしいです。\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@IcelandCrow/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ac0c78c1/uploads/origins/fe02a1bb-2bec-4d6a-bc03-b13d7397be79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae14e01a7519609e8d42d0c48a5848e5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ac0c78c1/uploads/origins/fe02a1bb-2bec-4d6a-bc03-b13d7397be79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae14e01a7519609e8d42d0c48a5848e5, https://si.imgix.net/ac0c78c1/uploads/origins/fe02a1bb-2bec-4d6a-bc03-b13d7397be79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ded7897fe40b5584e8eb58b8e6c58a9d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ac0c78c1/uploads/origins/fe02a1bb-2bec-4d6a-bc03-b13d7397be79?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f105c58d9793414e033ec71abca9fdfa 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您好，非常感谢您的呼吁！您的作品非常漂亮 🥰 请随心所欲地画我的角色。\n\n非常感谢您考虑我的请求！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/193qYtCHzosGHtzdQJLgBkp2lGoK6NxT0?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}